+++
title: Field Notes
description: Field notes from Yomonsni's coaches: short essays on discipline, change, creativity, leadership, and intimacy, drawn from our own lives and practice.
+++

Field notes are where our coaches think out loud: what we've noticed, what we've tried, and what we're still working out — in our own lives and alongside the people we coach. New notes are added regularly, newest first.

At the foot of each note you'll find the areas of coaching it speaks to, if you'd like to take the question further with one of us.
